+      "symbol": "add_deprecated_model_args",
+      "start_line": 863,
+      "end_line": 869,
+      "observation": "Just before `return parser` (line 869), get_parser calls add_deprecated_model_args(parser, group) so deprecated model shortcut flags are still parseable; the corresponding handler is applied later in main.py, showing a parse/handle split for backward-compatible options. The --config option is declared with is_config_file=True (lines 787-797) and --env-file is noted as an already-preparsed no-op for help display."
+    },
+    {
+      "path": "aider/main.py",
