+      "observation": "check_config_files_for_yes() inspects candidate config files for a legacy `yes:` key and prints a remediation message. It is invoked from the AttributeError handler around the first parse (main.py lines 481-487) to convert a cryptic configargparse failure into a descriptive, config-file-specific diagnostic."
