+      "observation": "load_dotenv_files() resolves the .env search list via generate_search_path_list (home, git root, cwd, explicit), prepends ~/.aider/oauth-keys.env if present, and loads each with override=True, returning the loaded filenames. main.py calls it between the first and second parse so that AIDER_* values coming from .env are visible to the re-parse."
