+    },
+    {
+      "claim": "Validation is layered: aider/args.py enforces structural validity at parse time through argparse choices/type (e.g. edit_format_choices derived from the coder registry for --edit-format, and the resolve_aiderignore_path `type=` normalizer for --aiderignore), while semantic validation such as --lint-cmd parsing happens later at runtime in aider/main.py.",
