+    "status": "passed",
+    "notes": "Focused AST/line-range validation script (run from the workspace root) verified: exact task_id/repository/mode metadata, presence of evidence/claims/conclusion/validation, that every evidence entry's inclusive start_line/end_line contains its named symbol, and that every required file (aider/args.py, aider/main.py) has at least one substantive evidence entry and at least one claim naming it. Full aider runtime import/tests were not run because aider imports third-party packages (configargparse, shtab, litellm, prompt_toolkit, etc.) that are not installed in this environment and installing dependencies is out of scope."
+  }
